# Contact form — Web3Forms access key.
# Create a form at https://web3forms.com and paste its access key here.
# Public by design: it ships in the client bundle, which is exactly why the
# Turnstile challenge below is what keeps spam out.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (the public half of the pair).
# Cloudflare dashboard → Turnstile → Add site. The secret key goes in the
# Web3Forms dashboard, never in this file.
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY=
